# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# multilingual-product-ranking — .gitignore
# Rewritten for this repo's layout (MIGRATION_PLAN.md §8). Not a copy of the
# old repo's file: the paths here are new-repo paths.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ — ALL contents ignored, directory skeleton kept.
#   data/raw/             upstream ESCI parquets; fetched, never vendored (§4)
#   data/task1/           Layer 1 core pool; REBUILT locally, not transferred
#   data/predictions/     frozen prediction parquets (§10.2a oracle)
#   data/legacy_features/ Layer 2; out-of-band, Phase 6b only, may be absent
# The negations keep the .gitkeep files so the structure stays documented.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/**
!/data/**/
!/data/**/.gitkeep

# --- Model weights and checkpoints (carried out-of-band; see artifacts/) ----
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.onnx
checkpoints/
final_model/

# --- Columnar / large data anywhere ----------------------------------------
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.feather

# --- Retrieval indexes (not built in this repo, but never commit one) ------
*.faiss
*.index

# --- Generated logs, figures, scratch --------------------------------------
*.log
*_stdout.log
*.png
*.jpg
*.pdf
_cache/
_cache*/

# --- TREC harness outputs ---------------------------------------------------
trec_eval_data/*.qrels
trec_eval_data/*.results

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# artifacts/ holds SMALL, TRACKED manifests and result tables. The global
# ignores above (*.parquet, *.csv is NOT globally ignored) must not swallow
# them, so re-include the tracked manifest formats explicitly.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!artifacts/**/*.json
!artifacts/**/*.csv
!artifacts/**/*.txt
!artifacts/**/*.md
